        "label": "Behaviour change is our goal",
        "hint": "Not completion rates",
        "kind": "letter",
        "bodyMdx": "Behaviour change is our goal.\n\nCompletion rate measures whether people clicked through a module. It is the easiest number to move and the least useful one to report.\n\nPhishing report rate is the number that matters: it only rises when somebody notices something, decides it is worth flagging, and trusts that flagging it will not make them look foolish. All three of those are culture, not training.",
